  "body": "Seven typed reported host-state components: BillingGate, UnsupportedHostNotice, NoDataState, LoadingBridgeState, OfflineState, PermissionDeniedState and ExpiredSessionState. Requests emit current identities only.\n\nIncludes the exact seven archives from passing CI source e441d73f704efdf90b98df8934e22180c7772aef: 102 unit checks, 14 desktop/narrow Chromium journeys, both strict installed consumers, builds and deterministic generation. Accepted source preserves the workflow and all nine immutable candidate parents.\n\nThese authored-state checks do not certify live billing, access, sessions, connectivity, external MCP hosts or physical devices. Public npm publication remains pending. Canonical evidence: docs/results/2026/11-10/host-state-checks.md."
